{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999040/extras/271a75a2c599008b54ae136b62970758.avif?t=1768944079\" width=640 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devoid is an immersive adventure for all fans of games like Dishonored, Thief, Gloomwood. Medieval cities are overrun, old kings are executed, and the surviving people are hiding in the slums - this marked the era of Vampires. Given a sword, shield, bow and other indispensable tools in battle, as well as magical powers, you will have to exterminate vampires, sneak behind their backs, solve puzzles for the sake of saving the human race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dark deity has endowed you with superpowers in return for depriving you of your soul, you will have to use them and various gadgets (bow, shield, magnetic tripwire, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999040/extras/df6348a2bff0f751e268b12f0669221a.poster.avif?t=1768944079\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999040/extras/df6348a2bff0f751e268b12f0669221a.webm?t=1768944079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999040/extras/df6348a2bff0f751e268b12f0669221a.mp4?t=1768944079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open combat is not terrible, because there is a reliable sword and different types of blows (light, heavy, falling, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999040/extras/50357ceace77e5b9d557fc4924dfceb1.poster.avif?t=1768944079\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999040/extras/50357ceace77e5b9d557fc4924dfceb1.webm?t=1768944079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999040/extras/50357ceace77e5b9d557fc4924dfceb1.mp4?t=1768944079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak around, distract enemies with various pick-up items, memorize their routes - all for the sake of a silent and quick elimination of the target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999040/extras/9e8905cc1991bb05c0fbd653f6068b42.poster.avif?t=1768944079\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999040/extras/9e8905cc1991bb05c0fbd653f6068b42.webm?t=1768944079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999040/extras/9e8905cc1991bb05c0fbd653f6068b42.mp4?t=1768944079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999040?t=1768944079","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999040?t=1768944079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999040/493f7decfb39f5c0ddeba090481e06abd90ecc9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768944079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999040/493f7decfb39f5c0ddeba090481e06abd90ecc9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768944079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"conten